docs: development retrospective and the varint case study

- docs/开发历程.md: why a fuzzer, the three decision lines (manual
  instrumentation, per-line flush instead of bisection, numbered corpus files),
  the two metric failures, how AI was used and where it was not, and what would
  be done differently
- docs/case-varint.md: a real bug end to end - symptom, replay, minimize,
  root cause with the LEB128 arithmetic, why hand-written tests miss it, the
  three possible fixes, the emitted regression test, and the CI gate
- README links every document; the acceptance checklist maps docs to the four
  review dimensions